# Scratch and orchestration artifacts — never commit
QUESTIONS.md
review-transcripts/
reviews/
*.log

# Dispatch working files: frozen briefs, hashes, leg logs, result JSON.
# These live here and NOT in /tmp, which is tmpfs on this machine and does
# not survive a reboot. A reboot on 2026-08-29 destroyed an in-flight leg's
# uncommitted work that was staged under /tmp.
.scratch/

# Pier / build artifacts
piers/
*.pill
.urb/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# NOTE: .claude/skills/ are symlinks into the Hermes skill store
# (~/.hermes/profiles/urbot/skills/). They are committed as symlinks so a
# fresh checkout on this machine resolves them; on any other machine they
# dangle and the agent should fall back to the repo's own docs + Brain pages.
.codex-brief.md
PHASE-A-REPORT.md
PUSH-HANDOFF.md

# Third-party app exports — REAL personal vehicle history.
# Never commit raw exports; sanitized same-format derivatives only.
aCar export/
aCar*export*/
*.abp
imports/raw/
tools/acar-import/out/
__pycache__/
